{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":6,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1252,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1873471,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":279872,"Name":"jengak5","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1411761486,"LastPoster":{"Id":279872,"Name":"jengak5","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":70,"Preview":{"Id":1879246,"PostDate":1417144625,"PostContent":"Hi Ladies! thank you for the feedback. Since there was such poor communication going on with the...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britt_k5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.173.33.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410958328,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jengak5","Id":279872,"Name":"jengak5","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.183.217.24","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78101,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b992524d08758b3a75f68208554d5427","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies.. I have a bit of a dilemma.. We are supposed to be heading to the Dreams Las Mareas on April 20th-27th, 2015. However we were just informed that the date we had chosen had been double booked and is unavailable. The only dates they have are the the day we arrive (the 20th), the next day (21st) and the day we leave (27th). Does anyone know of any offsite locations around that area that we may be able to host our wedding?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873471,"PostDate":1411761486,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies.. I have a bit of a dilemma.. We are supposed to be heading to the Dreams Las Mareas on April 20th-27th, 2015. However we were just informed that the date we had chosen had been double booked and is unavailable. The only dates they have are the the day we arrive (the 20th), the next day (21st) and the day we leave (27th). Does anyone know of any offsite locations around that area that we may be able to host our wedding?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britt_k5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.173.33.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410958328,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jengak5","Id":279872,"Name":"jengak5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.143.153.161","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78101,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91b70705d76c4a1a9e4f50f7071be361","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;How confident are you in the staff to pull it together if you chose the 21st date?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Obviously, the other ones are out.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Are you having a legal or symbolic ceremony?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Who is performing it?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Are you in contract with the property?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you made contact with their Wedding Coordinator? Are they just dumping the problem in your lap?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Do you have a travel agent?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is really unacceptable and should be able to be resolved with the property accommodating to assist you since it apparently their error.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What assistance have you received thus far?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873483,"PostDate":1411765144,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>How confident are you in the staff to pull it together if you chose the 21st date?<\/p>\n<p>Obviously, the other ones are out.<\/p>\n<p>Are you having a legal or symbolic ceremony?<\/p>\n<p>Who is performing it?<\/p>\n<p>Are you in contract with the property?<\/p>\n<p>Have you made contact with their Wedding Coordinator? Are they just dumping the problem in your lap?<\/p>\n<p>Do you have a travel agent?<\/p>\n<p>This is really unacceptable and should be able to be resolved with the property accommodating to assist you since it apparently their error.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What assistance have you received thus far?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"kathy@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"50.143.153.161","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1391018664,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TAkathy","Id":276390,"Name":"TAkathy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.71.158.229","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78101,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"230f07b0c1d767cc011c97539c94303c","RawContent":"@[member=\"jengak5\"] Congrats. I&#039;m sorry to hear that your date isn&#039;t available. My wedding is on 4\/17 at Las Mareas. There aren&#039;t many other options in that area. It&#039;s pretty secluded. Recreo is the only other resort close to the property. I think they have weddings on the beach in El Jobo or Rajada. If you want something inside, I don&#039;t think there is anything else close.","Attachments":[],"Id":1873557,"PostDate":1411853369,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279872\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279872-jengak5\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jengak5<\/span><\/a> Congrats. I'm sorry to hear that your date isn't available. My wedding is on 4\/17 at Las Mareas. There aren't many other options in that area. It's pretty secluded. Recreo is the only other resort close to the property. I think they have weddings on the beach in El Jobo or Rajada. If you want something inside, I don't think there is anything else close. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78101,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dced42ec958d725f3d3e06c363cdb081","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I agree with TA Kathy, especially since she&#039;s a master at this travel stuff. Has the resort just dumped this on you? When did you actually book and deposit your date? If you have rooms booked and guests, etc along with all of your reception details, I would be screaming blue murder at the resort and demanding that they fix it. And if you have a signed contract, that&#039;s definitely something for you to fall back on. They can&#039;t just arbitrarily renege on that deal. That&#039;s why a contract is signed in the first place!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and keep us posted on how you make out!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873604,"PostDate":1411934840,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I agree with TA Kathy, especially since she's a master at this travel stuff. Has the resort just dumped this on you? When did you actually book and deposit your date? If you have rooms booked and guests, etc along with all of your reception details, I would be screaming blue murder at the resort and demanding that they fix it. And if you have a signed contract, that's definitely something for you to fall back on. They can't just arbitrarily renege on that deal. That's why a contract is signed in the first place!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and keep us posted on how you make out!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.35.40.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78101,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1852c4c332bbf2d624fd64d5eb4c1b9e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jengak5\"] What ended up happening?? Was everything okay in the end?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877209,"PostDate":1414547341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279872\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279872-jengak5\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jengak5<\/span><\/a> What ended up happening?? Was everything okay in the end?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407874186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.173.33.31","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78101,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"edda7df6fb43701add58f2102dac8c1a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies! thank you for the feedback. Since there was such poor communication going on with the resort and everything and it was such a flip flop back inforth...&amp;nbsp;We ended up just switching resorts... I believe everything happens for a reason and now we are staying at the Westin and having our wedding at the Langosta Beach Club!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879246,"PostDate":1417144625,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies! thank you for the feedback. Since there was such poor communication going on with the resort and everything and it was such a flip flop back inforth...\u00a0We ended up just switching resorts... I believe everything happens for a reason and now we are staying at the Westin and having our wedding at the Langosta Beach Club!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britt_k5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.173.33.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410958328,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jengak5","Id":279872,"Name":"jengak5","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78101","Title":"Costa Rica Wedding Location","LastPostDate":1417144625},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
