arried (or planning to get married) at one of the AIs here. There is very limited information and reviews on DW at this location!\n \n Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":980625,"PostDate":1262498836,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi,<br \/> <br \/> I have heard that Cartegena is absolutely gorgeous! I'm in the early planning stages of our DW and was wondering if anyone has been married (or planning to get married) at one of the AIs here. There is very limited information and reviews on DW at this location!<br \/> <br \/> Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samantha_boyd@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1261680227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224080.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Samantha","Id":224080,"Name":"Samantha","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":46545,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61137c8d80aa26977b5df63d92c01d4d","RawContent":"We were going to get married in DR...then Cuba and now we are looking at Cartagena. I personally have never been there but my parents were there last year and they loved it. \n \n I have found a few places online that do weddings. Are you looking for an all inclusive? or do you want something more intimate in the old city?","Attachments":[],"Id":1009918,"PostDate":1264459809,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We were going to get married in DR...then Cuba and now we are looking at Cartagena. I personally have never been there but my parents were there last year and they loved it. <br \/> <br \/> I have found a few places online that do weddings. Are you looking for an all inclusive? or do you want something more intimate in the old city?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;51;116\/st\/20110111\/e\/Wedding+day+%3A%29\/k\/6887\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...6887\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cata.bloch@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1263714653,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224764.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Darcat","Id":224764,"Name":"Darcat","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":46545,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d1b6be33587184ca0061f28a6a4d0b2f","RawContent":"This thread is a little old, but I had to chip in:) I have a friend who was a bridesmaid in a wedding in Cartagena and it her pictures from it are INCREDIBLE!! After seeing them, Cartagena was actually my first choice for a DW. But my parents said absolutely not&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; The wedding was at the Santa Clara Hotel, and the guests all stayed there for the week as well. My former boss also used to travel there a lot for pleasure, and she always recommended this hotel to me: Charleston Santa Teresa Hotel &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i42.photobucket.com\/albums\/e309\/asable\/hotel.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i42.photobucket.com\/albums\/e309\/asable\/reception2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i42.photobucket.com\/albums\/e309\/asable\/reception.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The rehearsal dinner was at this fort\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i42.photobucket.com\/albums\/e309\/asable\/rehearsal1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n and they had to walk through these tunnels to get to it:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i42.photobucket.com\/albums\/e309\/asable\/rehearsal2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n Rehearsal dinner\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i42.photobucket.com\/albums\/e309\/asable\/rehearsal.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1070531,"PostDate":1268289671,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This thread is a little old, but I had to chip in:) I have a friend who was a bridesmaid in a wedding in Cartagena and it her pictures from it are INCREDIBLE!! After seeing them, Cartagena was actually my first choice for a DW. But my parents said absolutely not<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> The wedding was at the Santa Clara Hotel, and the guests all stayed there for the week as well. My former boss also used to travel there a lot for pleasure, and she always recommended this hotel to me: Charleston Santa Teresa Hotel <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i42.photobucket.com\/albums\/e309\/asable\/hotel.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i42.photobucket.com\/albums\/e309\/asable\/reception2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i42.photobucket.com\/albums\/e309\/asable\/reception.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The rehearsal dinner was at this fort<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i42.photobucket.com\/albums\/e309\/asable\/rehearsal1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> and they had to walk through these tunnels to get to it:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i42.photobucket.com\/albums\/e309\/asable\/rehearsal2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> Rehearsal dinner<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i42.photobucket.com\/albums\/e309\/asable\/rehearsal.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lexnic83@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1266393089,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225667.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mexbride83","Id":225667,"Name":"mexbride83","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"46545","Title":"Any weddings planned for Cartagena, Colombia?","LastPostDate":1268289671},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}